{"t_ms": 1574015, "conversation_id": "conv_immediate_s0_023", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Housekeeping Schedule\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nDaily housekeeping services are provided between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM. Guests who prefer not to be disturbed may activate the \"Do Not Disturb\" indicator outside their room. Additional cleaning requests or replenishment of towels and toiletries can be made by contacting housekeeping through the in-room telephone.", "Room Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nRoom service is available 24 hours a day for all in-house guests. A selection of Indian, Continental, and international dishes can be ordered using the in-room telephone. Estimated delivery time is 25 to 40 minutes, depending on the order and occupancy. Additional service charges may apply for certain premium menu items.", "Room Amenities Guide\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery guest room is equipped with complimentary Wi-Fi, air conditioning, a smart television, electronic safe, telephone, minibar, tea and coffee-making facilities, bottled drinking water, premium toiletries, fresh towels, and a hairdryer. Additional amenities such as an iron, ironing board, or extra pillows can be requested through housekeeping."], "scores": [0.5856620669364929, 0.6041867733001709, 0.6578025817871094], "filenames": ["15_housekeeping.txt", "23_room_service.txt", "14_room_amenities.txt"], "timing_policy": "immediate", "timing_trigger": "immediate", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 47, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
